  {
   "id": "9a4c676e22d6",
   "unit_id": "9a4c676e22d60e94750ceffed9c2e56617640ffa565aa82b8bc29ec0bb8d042e",
   "revision_key": "1a919ac56a4cb44d97d56e9fc56312b5eed262d3d23f8a596d5d54df8af60c18",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 6556,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Thank you, @playername@. I hate to admit it, but you saved my life.",
   "target": "谢谢你，@playername@。不得不承认，你救了我的命。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    21
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "9504ce727ee5",
   "unit_id": "9504ce727ee56ee938652141a22c33be144c4a96bf1ce199305b2cd1c8a5c192",
   "revision_key": "fd8ca074e9afb56e2d23152565b124cb0875a1bf85967b78d9941de4a21856bf",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 6557,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "At your service. But may I ask what you were doing in this dark place?",
   "target": "我乐意效劳，但你能告诉我你在这个黑暗的地方干什么吗？",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    23
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "39eaf3506583",
   "unit_id": "39eaf3506583e35fefacba42966c5b6016c2a9080831c59ced8621d90245b3f3",
   "revision_key": "b499f88374f66421b6a8c29a2f2f7e07edf6a682997beeab7193aa6186e8d272",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 6558,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "At your service. I have been gone for months, but I can feel it, at last this is my homeland!",
   "target": "我乐意效劳。我已经离开几个月了，不过我能够感觉到，这里就是我的故乡！",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    24
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "3fa8674d4ba6",
   "unit_id": "3fa8674d4ba688651826f263b9dd8e0f52ef9f88f19094847892ea47a9855d46",
   "revision_key": "ec9318805329a9d06f60d16141059667f666cf602b5e38c05b5577bec04a5e6f",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 6559,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "I am an Anorithil, a mage of the Sun and Moons; we fight all that is evil. I was with a group of Sun Paladins; we came from the Gates of Morning to the east.\nMy companions were... were slaughtered by orcs, and I nearly died as well. Thank you again for your help.",
   "target": "我是借用太阳和月亮力量的星月术士，来自东面的晨曦之门，同太阳骑士一起对抗邪恶。\n我的伙伴们…都被兽人杀死了，我也差点丧命，再次感谢你的帮助。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    29
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "e2a7514074f2",
   "unit_id": "e2a7514074f2be561495333dd0cdb9ed3a1a1be32fb8ce3b9d2b05e892ae6254",
   "revision_key": "97368c835c11b5208f49285c15f9560749a4abbf196760fdc040d155724dbf3a",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 6562,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "It was my pleasure. But may I ask a favor myself? I am not from these lands. I used a farportal guarded by orcs deep below the Iron Throne and was brought here.",
   "target": "我的荣幸，不过我有个请求。我其实不是这个大陆的人。我使用了钢铁王座地下深处一座由兽人把守的远行传送门，然后就被带到了这里。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    32
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "a6431947070f",
   "unit_id": "a6431947070f05379eae2f823bb1ac7f6d2a74c8e5ca0d62d7c0d28268963a8d",
   "revision_key": "01d3fbb522e8e4a92e2d15162c78f0c15a4450b235b663d3adbf616a1869a37f",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 6563,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Yes, I noticed you were not from here. Your only hope is the Gates of Morning, the last bastion of freedom in this orc territory. When you leave the caves, head southeast; you cannot miss it.\nTell High Sun Paladin Aeryn that you met me. I'll send word to let you pass.",
   "target": "是的，我也注意到了你不是这里的人。晨曦之门是兽人领地中仅存的自由堡垒，将是你的唯一希望。离开洞穴后往东南走；你一定能找到那里。\n告诉高阶太阳骑士艾琳你遇到了我，我会传信让他们放行。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    37
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "14a16ea09589",
   "unit_id": "14a16ea09589566046bc9941cf53966a6cc9f5212e30a8ceed5518edf21ea014",
   "revision_key": "f67185a01d1c75d803fdbb329098726e5c491a83e3286dcc132b57eed37872d2",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 6566,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Thank you, I will talk with Aeryn.",
   "target": "谢谢你，我会找艾琳谈谈的。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    40
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "fe46f0da8ffb",
   "unit_id": "fe46f0da8ffb1f31066231addb3545c81e544f9413f36a6eaa5b2c0100c6fbee",
   "revision_key": "3c04b46230b3b35a885ef9c8a29f4cfaa6875ee367418b9c27c9312ac74bbbeb",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 6567,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Gone? Wait, this face.. you are @playername@! We thought you died in the naga portal explosion!\nThanks to your courage the Gates of Morning still stand.\nYou should go there at once.",
   "target": "离开了？等一下，这张脸……你是 @playername@！我们都以为你在娜迦传送门爆炸的时候死了！\n因你的壮举，晨曦之门依然屹立不倒。\n你应该马上去那里。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/unremarkable-cave-fillarel.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    45
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
